  "content": "<p>新增武器：琵琶！（資源名稱：ef_pipa:pi_pa）</p><p>琵琶是中國傳統樂器，但我突發奇想，覺得它也可以當作武器使用！</p><p>就像這樣：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fZnmhu0-EGWs%253fsi%253d4EqWJMbD7Pv8ykoE%2526t%253d761\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/Znmhu0-EGWs?si=Mduview4pd4Ii_xf</a></p><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>新增四種自訂動作：auto_1、auto_2、auto_3 和 sonic_boom。</p>\n<p>你可以用琵琶四處敲擊</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f30a458d-9c16-4cea-abbc-83f0ffae99cc.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"176\"></p>\n<p>或是蓄積能量後，發射音爆！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e3f036eb-eeff-4a9f-8dc0-e1883587cf7a.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"176\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
